    "group": "Sly Marbo",
    "summary": "Once per turn, in the opposing player’s Shooting phase, this model can shoot back at an enemy unit that targets one of your **REGIMENT** units with a ranged attack while this model is within 3\" of that **REGIMENT** unit.\n\nIt shoots after the enemy unit finishes shooting, as though in your own Shooting phase. Its only allowed target is that enemy unit, and it can shoot only if that target is eligible.",
